@startuml
title "Reset my password if I forget it"

participant "BackEnd" as BackEnd

== Request Password Reset ==
-> BackEnd: Request password reset
-> BackEnd: Send user email to request reset
<--BackEnd: Send password reset link (with expiration)

== User Clicks Reset Link ==
-> BackEnd: Access reset form
-> BackEnd: Validate reset token
<-- BackEnd: Proceed to password reset form

== User Submits New Password ==
-> BackEnd: Submit new password
-> BackEnd: Send new password
<-- BackEnd: Password updated successfully
<-- BackEnd: Password reset successfully

@enduml

